T* /F2 10 Tf (3. PARTNERSHIP MODELS) Tj /F1 9 Tf
T* (A. REFERRAL MODEL \(Flexible & Low Operational Load\)) Tj
T* (   - Who it is for: Colleges, coaching centres, and communities introducing programs to students.) Tj
T* (   - Institutional Role: Student awareness, enrollment promotion, and partner code attribution.) Tj
T* (   - TCM One Role: Complete curriculum delivery, live interactive classes, AI support & evaluation.) Tj
T* (   - Commercial Terms: 15% - 25% institutional commission per verified paid enrollment.) Tj
T* (   - Payout Timelines: Monthly disbursement within 30 days of batch commencement.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (B. ACADEMIC PARTNERSHIP MODEL \(Deep Collaboration & Campus Delivery\)) Tj
T* (   - Who it is for: Colleges & institutes running co-branded semester courses or dedicated cohorts.) Tj
T* (   - Minimum Batch Size: 20 students per cohort.) Tj
T* (   - Institutional Infrastructure: Computer lab \(1 PC per student, 20Mbps+ internet, display projector\).) Tj
T* (   - Mentor Arrangement: Nominated institute faculty \(trained by TCM One\) or assigned TCM mentors.) Tj
T* (   - Commercial Terms: 35% - 50% institutional revenue share based on delivery model.) Tj
T* (   - Settlement: Milestone-based ledger with transparent enrollment reconciliation.) Tj
T* () Tj
